WEBVTT - Image Workbench (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.721
Editors download an image, crop it in a desktop tool and upload it again.

2
00:00:08.821 --> 00:00:14.163
Image Workbench opens images from the file list in a full-page editor.

3
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:21.460
Adjust, filter, annotate, crop and resize, right next to the photo.

4
00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:29.732
Describe a new image, and a PNG arrives in the same folder, through nr-llm.

5
00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:35.627
Save as copy is the default, so the original is never replaced.

6
00:00:36.927 --> 00:00:39.630
Image Workbench for TYPO3.
